    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22258" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλαῦκος</span></b> , ὁ, an eatable
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fish of grey colour</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				49
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				161
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				607b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.295c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as pr.
			n., esp. of a Chian inventor: hence prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἡ Γλαύκου τέχνη</span>, c. inf., 'it
			does not need a genius to . . ', <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				108d
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
